OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fwill sink southeastwards across
OL,7,FEngland and Wales overnight. Heavy and
OL,8,Fblustery showers are likely in the far
OL,9,Fnorth and northwest. Clear spells,
OL,10,Fpatchy fog and grass frost elsewhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMost southern and eastern
OL,13,Fareas will have a fine day on Saturday
OL,14,Fwith some sunshine. Cloudier in the
OL,15,Fnorth and west with scattered showers,
OL,16,Fthese blustery in the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
